# Canonical author and committer identities for SEE.
#
# Git applies this file to %aN, %aE, %cN and %cE, and therefore to git shortlog,
# git blame, git log --author and anything built on those.
#
# Canonical address: the address the person used most often, ignoring GitHub's
#     @users.noreply.github.com addresses, which are aliases rather than real
#     mailboxes.
# Canonical name: the fullest form that actually occurs in the history. Where
#     only a login or a nickname occurs, that is what stands here; replace it
#     with the real name where you know it.
#
# Generated from the identities found in the history; grouping was done by
# matching addresses and names, so please check the people you know before
# relying on it. Cases that could not be decided from the data are listed,
# commented out, at the end.

